<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Eagle Hardware rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Eagle Hardware rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Pacific Crest Securities said it initiated coverage of Eagle Hardware &amp; Garden Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>- Strong regional economy and closure of a competitor will help Eagle achieve same-store sales growth of 12 percent this year, analyst Laura Richardson said in a brief report.</p>
<p>- Stock price has come down from 30 last fall with no change in fundamentals and could rise back to 30.</p>
</text>
